   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Hay una forma más corta: **못** delante del verbo. **못 가요** = no puedo ir. **못 먹어요** = no puedo comer.",
     "@en": "There is a shorter form: **못** in front of the verb. **못 가요** = I cannot go. **못 먹어요** = can't eat."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Compara: **안** 가요 = no voy (no quiero o no toca). **못** 가요 = no puedo ir.",
     "@en": "Compare: **안** 가요 = I'm not going (I don't want to or don't touch). **못** 가요 = I can't go."
    },
    "Con 해요: **못해요** = no sé, no se me da."
   ]
